HST Office: the new Start Center (the window shown when no document is open).

- Left: the HST Office logo; Trang chủ, Tài liệu mới (menu: Văn bản, Bảng tính, Trình chiếu, Bản vẽ, Từ mẫu…),
  Mở tệp, Gần đây, Đã ghim, Cập nhật HST Office (org.hst.office.update:Check, the ribbon Help tab's update
  check); below a separator the HASON TECH block: the rotating banner (vcl HstBannerWidget, signed feed fetched
  on worker threads), the six solutions and the link to hasontech.vn. No shared files, no account.
- Centre: welcome, a search box that filters the recent documents by name with or without Vietnamese accents,
  three tiles (text document, spreadsheet, presentation) and the recent documents table (Tên, Đã mở, Vị trí,
  pin, "⋯" menu: Mở, Mở vị trí tệp, Ghim/Bỏ ghim, Xóa khỏi danh sách).
- Right: the pinned files (the history's own pinned flag, kept in the profile).
- Narrow windows: the pinned column folds into the table, then the menu shows glyphs only. File times are read
  on a worker thread; no thumbnails are loaded.

Hook: sfx2/source/dialog/backingcomp.cxx creates HstStartCenterWindow instead of BackingWindow (4 lines);
makefile and translation entries. The logic is in new HST files (LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary):
sfx2/source/startcenter/*, sfx2/inc/startcenter/*, sfx2/uiconfig/ui/hststartcenter.ui.
